# Bodies of the harness files a project may vendor into its fuzz directory:
# <release tag or harness commit> <file> <sha256 of the file as it is in the harness at that point>
# A vendored copy carries a comment header naming its source ("Vendored from fv-harness <id>");
# fuzz/check_vendored.sh FAILs COUPLE unless the copy below its header hashes to the line for that id.
# A release tag (vX.Y.Z) is added once, at the release, and never changed; it must match exactly.
# A commit id may be abbreviated. Pin lines for a commit are added in a LATER commit (a commit
# cannot contain its own id), before any project vendors from it.
